{"name":"Pinkwash","hex":"#f2dbd2","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"pinkwash","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To cover in a coat of pink paint.","To promote consumer goods or services by supporting breast cancer-related charities."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pinkwash"}],"entries":[{"title":"Pinkwashing (breast cancer)","blocks":[{"text":"Pinkwashing is a form of cause marketing that uses pink ribbon logos. The companies display the pink ribbon logo on products that are known to cause different types of cancer. The Pink ribbon logo symbolizes support for breast cancer-related charities or foundations."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/Photo_of_Pink_ribbon.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinkwashing_(breast_cancer)","wikidata":"Q25339223"},{"title":"Pinkwashing (LGBTQ)","blocks":[{"text":"Pinkwashing, also known as rainbow-washing, is the strategy of deploying messages that are superficially sympathetic towards the LGBTQ community for ends having little or nothing to do with LGBTQ equality or inclusion, including in rainbow capitalism and other forms of LGBTQ marketing."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Marche_des_fiert%C3%A9s_Rennes_2018_%2827987350107%29.jpg/330px-Marche_des_fiert%C3%A9s_Rennes_2018_%2827987350107%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinkwashing_(LGBTQ)","wikidata":"Q20200811"},{"title":"Pinkwash (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Pinkwash is an American punk rock band formed in 2014 in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, United States. After releasing 2 EPs on Sister Polygon Records they released their debut album on Don Giovanni Records in 2016."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinkwash_(band)","wikidata":"Q25056817"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/%D7%9E%D7%A9%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%99%D7%A6%D7%95%D7%AA_%D7%A4%D7%A2%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%94_%D7%95%D7%A8%D7%95%D7%93%D7%94_2.jpg/500px-%D7%9E%D7%A9%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%99%D7%A6%D7%95%D7%AA_%D7%A4%D7%A2%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%94_%D7%95%D7%A8%D7%95%D7%93%D7%94_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/%D7%9E%D7%A9%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%99%D7%A6%D7%95%D7%AA_%D7%A4%D7%A2%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%94_%D7%95%D7%A8%D7%95%D7%93%D7%94_2.jpg/1280px-%D7%9E%D7%A9%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%99%D7%A6%D7%95%D7%AA_%D7%A4%D7%A2%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%94_%D7%95%D7%A8%D7%95%D7%93%D7%94_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/%D7%9E%D7%A9%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%99%D7%A6%D7%95%D7%AA_%D7%A4%D7%A2%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%94_%D7%95%D7%A8%D7%95%D7%93%D7%94_2.jpg/500px-%D7%9E%D7%A9%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%99%D7%A6%D7%95%D7%AA_%D7%A4%D7%A2%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%94_%D7%95%D7%A8%D7%95%D7%93%D7%94_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Anarcho-queer collective Mashpritzot hold a die-in protest against Israeli pinkwashing and the perceived homonormative priorities of the LGBTQ support center in Tel Aviv","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A%D7%9E%D7%A9%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%99%D7%A6%D7%95%D7%AA_%D7%A4%D7%A2%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%94_%D7%95%D7%A8%D7%95%D7%93%D7%94_2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Europride2024.jpg/500px-Europride2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Europride2024.jpg/1280px-Europride2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Europride2024.jpg/500px-Europride2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A participant in the 2024 EuroPride in Thessaloniki holding a picket that reads \"NO PRIDE IN GENOCIDE\"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEuropride2024.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}